{"title":"Visionary Public Speaking Club - Practice Your Public Speaking Skills With Us ","startsAt":"2026-11-19T18:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-19T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Are you looking to enhance your public speaking skills and boost your confidence? If so, then join us for an exciting Public Speaking meeting! Get inspired by one of the prepared speeches, or be brave and participate in our fun table topics.\n\nThe meetings at our club provide a save space for you to practice speaking in front of others, receive constructive feedback, and develop your public speaking skills.\n\nWe believe that everyone can learn how to become a great speaker and we welcome everyone who want to join us in person for one of our meetings and improve their public speaking skills.\n\nDon't miss out on this chance to take your public speaking skills to the next level and meet other like-minded individuals. Join us at our next meeting and start building your confidence and leadership skills today!\n\nPlease reach out to the Event Host if you have any questions.\n\nThis event is not hosted by or sponsored by the Toronto Public Library","venue":{"name":"Toronto Public Library - Fort York Branch","address":"190 Fort York Blvd, Toronto","lat":43.63923,"lng":-79.40041,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Visionary Public Speaking Club","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/0/8/f/highres_506569295.jpeg"}